  "description": "Method actor Park Se-Ha and flop idol Sohn Ji-Eon are cast as lovers in a queer crime film. What begins as open hostility born from clashing backgrounds slowly transforms through forced rehearsals and intimate method acting. As Ji-Eon’s sincerity and relentless effort break down Se-Ha’s defenses, professional boundaries blur into dangerous attraction. Determined to call their growing closeness a “mistake,” both men struggle to separate acting from reality. Caught between obsession and devotion, they must decide whether their connection is merely part of the role… or something real.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
